cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "4680 cell models: thermal DFN model, open parameter sets and data for NMC and LFP 4680 cells"
message: "If you use these parameter sets or data, please cite the paper and this dataset."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Teodorescu
    given-names: Remus
    affiliation: "AAU Energy, Aalborg University"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2617-7168"
