license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
repository: "https://github.com/RemusTeodorescu/4680-cell-models"
abstract: >-
  A thermal Doyle-Fuller-Newman model (finite-volume solver) and provenance-tagged parameter sets (BPX JSON, CSV, JSON) for the Tesla NMC811/graphite
  4680 cell and the BYD FC4680 LiFePO4/graphite cell, with closure checks, bench-test data
  of the BYD FC4680 (1C and 2C discharges with can temperatures), digitised published
  measurements of the Tesla 4680 and the calibration logs.
keywords:
  - lithium-ion battery
  - 4680 cylindrical cell
  - Doyle-Fuller-Newman model
  - BPX
  - LiFePO4
  - NMC811
  - thermal modelling
